   "text": "SQL engine that runs inside the Python process (like SQLite, but for analytics) and queries\nParquet/CSV files directly. Replaces a database server.",
   "originalText": "SQL engine that runs inside the Python process (like SQLite, but for analytics) and queries\nParquet/CSV files directly. Replaces a database server.",
