   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Vectorised array and dataframe libraries. The simulator processes all shoppers in a tick at once\ninstead of looping one by one, which makes it fast.",
   "originalText": "Vectorised array and dataframe libraries. The simulator processes all shoppers in a tick at once\ninstead of looping one by one, which makes it fast.",
