   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Randomness keyed by (seed, mechanism, entity, event slot, tick), so identical seeds give\nidentical runs and an intervention that changes event counts does not shift other entities'\ndraws. Updated 21 Nov (gate S7).",
   "originalText": "Randomness keyed by (seed, mechanism, entity, event slot, tick), so identical seeds give\nidentical runs and an intervention that changes event counts does not shift other entities'\ndraws. Updated 21 Nov (gate S7).",
