   "text": "Pearl's do-operator: forcing a lever (price, error rate, carrier speed) to a value, rather than\njust observing it. This is how scenarios inject causes.",
   "originalText": "Pearl's do-operator: forcing a lever (price, error rate, carrier speed) to a value, rather than\njust observing it. This is how scenarios inject causes.",
